1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,700
1945. My dearest one, I have just heard the news that all the army men taken POW are to

2
00:00:08,700 --> 00:00:13,280
return to their homes. Because of the shipping situation, we may not commence to go before

3
00:00:13,280 --> 00:00:19,800
the end of February, but can probably count on being in England sometime in March. Maybe

4
00:00:19,800 --> 00:00:29,800
sooner. It has made me very warm inside. It's terrific. It's wonderful. Shattering.

5
00:00:29,800 --> 00:00:30,300
I don't know.

6
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:35,679
what to say and I cannot think. The delay is nothing. The decision is everything. Now

7
00:00:35,679 --> 00:00:41,780
I am confirming in my head the little decisions I have made when contemplating just the possibility.

8
00:00:41,780 --> 00:00:45,960
I must spend the first days at home. I must see Deb and her mother. I must consider giving

9
00:00:45,960 --> 00:00:55,519
a party somewhere. Above all, I must be with you. I must warm you, surround you, love you

10
00:00:55,519 --> 00:01:00,039
and be kind to you. Tell me anything that's in your mind.

11
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:07,120
mind, write tons and tons and tons and plan our time. I would prefer not to get

12
00:01:07,120 --> 00:01:15,120
married, but want you to agree on the point.

13
00:01:19,280 --> 00:01:28,879
In the battle I was afraid for you, for my mother, for myself. Wait, we must, my

14
00:01:28,879 --> 00:01:31,680
love, my darling.

15
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:37,200
Let us meet, let us be, let us know, but do not let us now make any mistakes.

16
00:01:37,200 --> 00:01:42,299
I am anxious, very anxious, that you should not misunderstand what I have said.

17
00:01:42,299 --> 00:01:50,019
Say what you think, but please agree and remember I was afraid and I am still afraid.

18
00:01:50,019 --> 00:01:53,640
How good for us to see each other before I am completely bald!

19
00:01:53,640 --> 00:01:59,960
Have a few fine wisps of hair on the top of my head.

20
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:04,480
Not much good me trying to write about recent experiences now that I know I shall be able

21
00:02:04,480 --> 00:02:08,159
to tell you everything myself within such a short time.

22
00:02:08,159 --> 00:02:12,319
What I have my eye on now is the first letter from you saying that you know I am alright

23
00:02:12,319 --> 00:02:15,840
and then next saying you know I am coming to you.

24
00:02:15,840 --> 00:02:19,920
Must try and keep out of hospital with some of these post-POW complaints.

25
00:02:19,920 --> 00:02:24,680
Plan a week somewhere, not Boscombe or Bournemouth, and think of being together.

26
00:02:24,680 --> 00:02:28,280
The glory of you.

27
00:02:28,280 --> 00:02:30,000
When I was captive I used to try and...

28
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:32,680
and contact you and think hard.

29
00:02:32,680 --> 00:02:35,400
Bessie, my dearest, I'm all right.

30
00:02:35,400 --> 00:02:36,479
Do not worry.

31
00:02:38,439 --> 00:02:40,879
I never thought that I would get through somehow,

32
00:02:40,879 --> 00:02:42,639
but now it's over and you know that I'm all right

33
00:02:42,639 --> 00:02:45,840
and gonna be with you soon to join and enjoy.

34
00:02:47,280 --> 00:02:50,120
Do not get very excited outwardly.

35
00:02:50,120 --> 00:02:52,120
I am conscious of the inner tumult, the clamor,

36
00:02:52,120 --> 00:02:54,360
but I am not too much outwardly joyful.

37
00:02:54,360 --> 00:02:55,800
Moderation is my advice.

38
00:02:55,800 --> 00:02:57,800
Watch the buses as you cross the streets.

39
00:02:57,800 --> 00:02:58,780
Disinational.

40
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:05,340
We're free of duties and yesterday I went to our friends in Athens taking some of your

41
00:03:05,340 --> 00:03:10,159
coffee and cocoa which they were very pleased to have. Thank you for sending it. We were

42
00:03:10,159 --> 00:03:16,159
embraced very excitedly kissing and so on, continental fashion.

43
00:03:16,159 --> 00:03:23,159
I hope that you will not start buying any clothes if you have any coupons left because

44
00:03:23,159 --> 00:03:28,159
you think you must look nice for me. I shall be sorry if you do. Just carry on.

45
00:03:30,000 --> 00:03:35,560
on as near as possible to normal. My return at the present time allows us to make public

46
00:03:35,560 --> 00:03:41,400
our mutual attachment. I shall tell my family that I hope to spend a week away with you

47
00:03:41,400 --> 00:03:49,180
somewhere during my leave. My counsel to you is to tell as few people as possible. To someone

48
00:03:49,180 --> 00:03:53,159
like Miss Ferguson, you can politely reply to observations that you thought it was your

49
00:03:53,159 --> 00:03:59,960
business rather than hers. Try to avoid preening yourself and saying much. This is my advice

50
00:03:59,960 --> 00:04:00,960
to you.

51
00:04:00,960 --> 00:04:01,960
Thank you.

52
00:04:01,960 --> 00:04:02,960
Thank you.

53
00:04:02,960 --> 00:04:03,960
Thank you.

54
00:04:03,960 --> 00:04:04,960
Thank you.

55
00:04:04,960 --> 00:04:05,960
Thank you.

56
00:04:05,960 --> 00:04:06,960
Thank you.

57
00:04:06,960 --> 00:04:07,960
Thank you.

58
00:04:07,960 --> 00:04:08,960
Thank you.

59
00:04:08,960 --> 00:04:09,960
Thank you.

60
00:04:09,960 --> 00:04:10,960
Thank you.

61
00:04:10,960 --> 00:04:11,960
Thank you.

62
00:04:11,960 --> 00:04:12,960
Thank you.

63
00:04:12,960 --> 00:04:13,960
Thank you.

64
00:04:13,960 --> 00:04:14,960
Thank you.

65
00:04:14,960 --> 00:04:15,960
Thank you.

66
00:04:15,960 --> 00:04:16,959
Thank you.

67
00:04:16,959 --> 00:04:17,959
Thank you.

68
00:04:17,959 --> 00:04:18,959
Thank you.

69
00:04:18,959 --> 00:04:19,959
Thank you.

70
00:04:19,959 --> 00:04:20,959
Thank you.

71
00:04:20,959 --> 00:04:21,959
Thank you.

72
00:04:21,959 --> 00:04:22,959
Thank you.

73
00:04:22,959 --> 00:04:23,959
Thank you.

74
00:04:23,959 --> 00:04:24,959
Thank you.

75
00:04:24,959 --> 00:04:25,959
Thank you.

76
00:04:25,959 --> 00:04:26,959
Thank you.

77
00:04:26,959 --> 00:04:27,959
Thank you.

78
00:04:27,959 --> 00:04:28,959
Thank you.

79
00:04:00,000 --> 00:04:01,479
Not anything but that.

80
00:04:02,719 --> 00:04:03,879
I hope you understand.

81
00:04:05,520 --> 00:04:09,520
I do not ever want it to be anything but our affair.

82
00:04:09,520 --> 00:04:11,840
Do not permit any intrusion.

83
00:04:14,340 --> 00:04:17,100
I do not know how long leave I shall get.

84
00:04:17,100 --> 00:04:18,959
I could get as little as 14 days

85
00:04:18,959 --> 00:04:20,660
and I may get as much as a month.

86
00:04:22,000 --> 00:04:25,560
I'm wondering how I shall tell you that I am in England.

87
00:04:25,560 --> 00:04:26,519
Probably it would still be quicker

88
00:04:26,519 --> 00:04:28,040
to send a telegram than a letter

89
00:04:28,040 --> 00:04:29,420
and I hope to send you one,

90
00:04:29,420 --> 00:04:30,259
announcing that.

91
00:04:30,000 --> 00:04:34,040
I am on the same island. I will send another when I'm actually soon to get on the London-bound

92
00:04:34,040 --> 00:04:39,939
train and you can ring Lee Green 0509 when you think I have arrived there.

93
00:04:39,939 --> 00:04:45,399
You must bear in mind that I shall be with my brother until we get home. Also, that having

94
00:04:45,399 --> 00:04:49,720
been away from home for so long, my parents will want to see a lot of me.

95
00:04:49,720 --> 00:04:56,519
I hope that everything will work itself out without any unhappiness to anyone. I shall

96
00:04:56,519 --> 00:04:59,399
be in great demand from two or three points and it will be difficult to manage without

97
00:04:59,399 --> 00:04:59,959
offence.

98
00:05:00,000 --> 00:05:11,800
Strange thing, but I cannot seem to get going and write very freely. All I'm thinking about

99
00:05:11,800 --> 00:05:18,879
is I am going home, I'm going to see her. It's a fact, a real thing, an impending event

100
00:05:18,879 --> 00:05:28,620
like Trove Tuesday, Christmas Day, or the Lord Mayor's Banquet. You have to be abroad,

101
00:05:28,620 --> 00:05:29,939
you have to be really, truly...

102
00:05:30,000 --> 00:05:32,839
Permetically sealed off from your intimates,

103
00:05:32,839 --> 00:05:37,839
from your home to realize what a gift this going home is.

104
00:05:40,959 --> 00:05:42,699
The few letters of yours that I had on me,

105
00:05:42,699 --> 00:05:45,319
I burnt the day previous to our surrender,

106
00:05:45,319 --> 00:05:47,839
so no one but myself has read your words.

107
00:05:48,959 --> 00:05:50,759
In the first 10 days of our captivity,

108
00:05:50,759 --> 00:05:52,459
I did not think any soft thoughts about you.

109
00:05:52,459 --> 00:05:55,519
All I did was concentrate on trying to tell you

110
00:05:55,519 --> 00:05:56,500
I was all right.

111
00:05:56,500 --> 00:06:00,139
But when we had a few supplies dropped by aircraft...

112
00:06:00,000 --> 00:06:04,560
great risk to themselves in the misty snow-bound Greek mountain villages, and we started hoping

113
00:06:04,560 --> 00:06:10,560
we might get sent home upon our release. I was always wondering about you, about us.

114
00:06:10,560 --> 00:06:17,240
It is a pity that the winter weather will not be kind to us out of doors, but it would

115
00:06:17,240 --> 00:06:21,680
be nice sitting next to you in the pictures, no matter what may be on the screen. It would

116
00:06:21,680 --> 00:06:25,279
be grand to know that we have each other's support and sympathy.

117
00:06:25,279 --> 00:06:30,000
Wouldn't it be wonderful to be together, really together.

118
00:06:30,000 --> 00:06:38,019
in the flesh, not just to know that the letter is all we can send.

119
00:06:38,019 --> 00:06:39,980
I love you, Chris.

